<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $50 mln note issue.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $50 mln note issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Monday said it will redeem all outstanding amounts of one medium-term note issue totalling $50 million as follows.</p>
<p>  Principal     Interest    Maturity    Cusip     Redemption</p>
<p>   Amount	   Rate	  Date	Number	Date</p>
<p> $50 million	7.08	08/28/01   31364CKC1   08/28/97</p>
<p>The redemption price of the note will be 100 percent of the principal amount plus interest accrued to the redemption date, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
